@cc [owner:OctavianTocan,label:product;architecture] shared-file-diff-links-keep-the-github-anchor
FileLinks MUST retain its Android package and API on both hosts. A file diff link
MUST append the lower-case SHA-256 of the exact UTF-8 path bytes, without case folding
or normalization, and append `/files` only for a pull request. It MUST use the same
platform digest as existing LinkPlaces rather than maintain another digest algorithm.
Source: the original FileLinks implementation and anchor test retained by Tavi's
21 Oct 2026 maximum-reuse iOS decision; DESIGN.md rule 124.

