Call and file-tree parsing MUST retain row order, hierarchy, name/comment boundaries,
ancestor paths and guide continuations from the existing Sketch parser. Pseudocode
runs MUST rejoin to the exact input line while preserving their token kind. Source:
existing Sketch.kt/SketchTest, DESIGN.md rule 95 and F59, preserved by Tavi's
21 Oct 2026 maximum-reuse iOS decision.

@cc [owner:OctavianTocan,label:security;architecture] pele-svg-is-inert
Pele's SVG MUST reach a host only as inert vector data that both diagram adapters read:
the drawn elements (svg, g, path, rect, circle, ellipse, polygon, polyline, line, text,
tspan) with the iOS adapter's attributes, every CSS variable, color-mix() and
currentColor resolved against the app palette, styles written out as attributes, links
reduced to groups, and pictures, gradients, embedded HTML, ids and classes left out.
Anything but well-formed SVG MUST fail. Diagram text MUST reach Pele only as a JSON
string, never as code, with links and pictures off. Source: Tavi, 28 Oct 2026, "For Mermaid diagrams, find Obsidian's Pele, and use that."
